      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "scope",
          "chain"
        ],
        "note": "3 rows: 3201 <- 301, 3301 <- 301 and 3401 <- 301. MOVES's own statement that all three nitrogen species are CHAINED pollutants, each computed by scaling the total-NOx parent rather than from a rate of its own -- `NOCalculator` produces NO and HONO, `NO2Calculator` produces NO2, and both chain off `BaseRateCalculator` (calculator-dag.json: subscribes_directly false, depends_on BaseRateCalculator). One chain row per species, and one parent for all three, so the document reads the chain from here rather than writing `32 = ratio x 3` anywhere.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
    "nox_nono2ratio": {
      "kind": "static",
      "source": {
        "url_template": "../../moves.rs/characterization/snapshots/process-nox-speciation/tables/db__movesexecution1ccc0232_campuscluster_illinois_edu__nono2ratio.parquet"
