          "ratioGPA"
        ]
      },
      "extent": {
        "metaparameter": "n_criteriaratio"
      },
      "metadata": {
        "tags": [
          "adjustment",
          "fuel"
        ],
        "note": "733 rows, all polProcessID 301: the criteria-pollutant FUEL EFFECT, per (fuelFormulationID, polProcessID, sourceTypeID, modelYearID, ageID). It is an INPUT here and not something this document computes: `FuelEffectsGenerator` builds it from `generalfuelratioexpression`'s closed-form strings plus the Complex + sulfur model for model years <= 2000, and moves.rs gates that reconstruction on `criteriaRatio` being empty -- 'the snapshot/onroad path ships it captured' (fueleffectsgenerator/criteria.rs). For source type 21 the supplied formulations carry ratios from 0.50102 to 1.00385, so this is not a decorative factor: dropping it halves the gasoline NOx of the newest model years.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
