          "description": "emissionratebyage.ageGroupID -- the key column `emissionrate` does not have, and the whole reason this fixture reads a different rate table from every fixture before it. Seven groups (3, 405, 607, 809, 1014, 1519, 2099) partition the 41 age categories, and the rate join carries this alongside the four source-bin slots. It is also a ROW-SET key and not only a value: fuel type 9 has no group-2099 row, so the model year 2000 electricity cohort finds no rate and is not emitted, while 2001-2020 find one and are emitted at rate zero.",
