          "description": "temperatureadjustment.tempAdjustTermA. The table's four rows are all polProcessID 301, fuelTypeID 2, model years 2027-2060 -- outside this run's 1980-2020 entirely -- so every cohort takes the aggregate's additive identity 0, which is the Rust's `unwrap_or_default`. The temperature TERM is therefore 0 on every emitted row and the whole NOx factor is the humidity correction.",
