            "nono2ratio_rows"
          ],
          "description": "nono2ratio.fuelTypeID -- 1, 2 and 5, and NEVER 9. That absence is what removes the whole electricity column from the three species blocks, and it is read rather than written: the chain's inner join simply finds nothing.",
          "update": {
