          ],
          "description": "nono2ratio.modelYearGroupID. A GROUP and not a band, which is the structural difference from `pm10emissionratio`: the group has to be resolved through `pollutantprocessmappedmodelyear` for the species' own polProcessID before the ratio can be joined at all (NOCalculation1's `INNER JOIN NOCopyOfPPMY ON modelYearGroupID AND polProcessID`).",
          "update": {
