          "description": "noxhumidityadjust.humidityNOxEq -- `CFR 86` or `CFR 1065`, decoded to 86 and 1065 by a `codes` map on the binding. An EQUATION carried as data, which is why the two forms are two filtered aggregates here and not one expression with a coefficient switch.",
          "update": {
