          "shape": [
            "noxhumidityadjust_rows"
          ],
          "description": "noxhumidityadjust.humidityTermB, 0.832 on the CFR 1065 row and NULL -- hence NaN -- on the two CFR 86 rows. It is read only inside an aggregate whose filter has already excluded those rows, so the NaN never reaches an operator; a document that folded both forms into one expression would return NaN for every gasoline cohort.",
