          "description": "J23, as a LEFT JOIN: the value and the existence are separate aggregates because a missing row is a factor of ONE and the additive identity is zero. polProcessID 301 HAS 23 rows here -- 6.26 at idle, 1.38077 at every other mode -- so unlike brake and tire wear this column is a real number and not a computed zero. What makes it inert is the A/C ACTIVITY term, one factor further on."
        },
