          ],
          "description": "`NOCalculator` and `NO2Calculator`'s whole arithmetic: the NOx parent's quantity, at the SAME cohort and day, times `NOxRatio`. It is a SELF-JOIN of the rate relation -- the chained row and the row it is chained from are two rows of one relation -- so the clause names its two sides with `syms`."
        },
        "rtDay_quant": {
