        {
          "id": "the_drive_cycle_weights_are_a_distribution_over_the_twenty_three_running_modes",
          "description": "W, checked on the two properties that do not require the reference. It is a DISTRIBUTION: the weights sum to the avgSpeedFraction column's own total, which is 1 to that column's six stored significant figures and not exactly, so the gate is ABSOLUTE at 1e-5 and not relative (docs/esm-conventions.md 20.5). And it covers exactly 23 operating modes -- the same 23 `emissionratebyage` carries a polProcessID 301 rate for.",
